1
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:17,670
No matter what kind of demon curse
you're under,

2
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:19,240
I can break it.

3
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,950
This lady is afflicted with

4
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:23,680
the Zhan Gu.

5
00:00:24,410 --> 00:00:27,410
As the saying goes,
"When a person dies, he becomes a ghost,

6
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:29,480
and when a ghost dies, it becomes a Zhan."

7
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:32,880
The Zhan Gu is an extremely yin
and highly dangerous Gu curse.

8
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:45,080
I've specially prepared

9
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:47,810
a Heavenly Dragon
from Mount Lingyun for you.

10
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:51,340
With its own pure yang energy,

11
00:00:51,810 --> 00:00:55,080
it can break all Gu curses in the world.

12
00:00:57,930 --> 00:00:59,260
Then allow me, Wantang,

13
00:00:59,570 --> 00:01:01,370
to thank you in advance, Master.

14
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,570
But

15
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,330
how exactly are you going to
use this Heavenly Dragon

16
00:01:05,330 --> 00:01:06,360
to break my curse?

17
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:08,360
Hold out your hand.

18
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:56,880
What a pity.

19
00:01:57,330 --> 00:01:58,729
This Heavenly Dragon...

20
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,210
is dead.

21
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:02,520
Then, if I eat it now,

22
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:04,640
will it still work?

23
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:16,570
This clearly means

24
00:02:17,010 --> 00:02:18,610
there is a curse within the Gu

25
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,890
and a Gu within the curse.

26
00:02:19,890 --> 00:02:21,220
This is far from simple.

27
00:02:21,329 --> 00:02:21,960
Master,

28
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,360
is there

29
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,290
any other way now?

30
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:28,560
Please give me a few days, Miss Jiang.

31
00:02:28,670 --> 00:02:30,930
I'll definitely come to break the curse.

32
00:02:31,270 --> 00:02:32,579
In that case,

33
00:02:33,210 --> 00:02:34,410
I'll stay here for now

34
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:36,920
and await your arrival, Master Mei.

35
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:27,060
[A Prophet]

36
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:29,970
[Episode 12]

37
00:04:33,409 --> 00:04:36,170
These all belonged to our ancestors?

38
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,200
Inside

39
00:04:37,730 --> 00:04:39,730
lies the wealth from your past life.

40
00:04:41,170 --> 00:04:42,630
Then how do I take them out?

41
00:04:42,930 --> 00:04:43,930
I can help you,

42
00:04:44,610 --> 00:04:45,240
but

43
00:04:45,650 --> 00:04:47,320
don't blame me
for not warning you in advance.

44
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:49,520
You have far too much past-life wealth.

45
00:04:49,730 --> 00:04:52,060
If you let your greed
get the better of you,

46
00:04:52,170 --> 00:04:53,050
your fate

47
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,770
might be even worse than Mr. Jing's.

48
00:04:55,770 --> 00:04:56,970
Don't worry, Master.

49
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,480
I'll only take what I can handle.

50
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:01,090
In that case...

51
00:05:02,410 --> 00:05:03,320
as you wish.

52
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,650
Thank you, Master, for granting my wish.

53
00:05:05,650 --> 00:05:06,710
Thank you, Master.

54
00:05:37,380 --> 00:05:38,590
[Light the fire]

55
00:05:45,409 --> 00:05:47,670
His might commands the desolate realms.

56
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:50,060
His keen blade embodies righteousness.

57
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:52,330
He commands the winds and clouds,

58
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:54,240
♪ A, B, C, D, E ♪

59
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,490
and suppresses the demons' baleful aura.

60
00:05:54,260 --> 00:05:56,990
♪ Spouting nonsense endlessly ♪

61
00:05:54,740 --> 00:05:56,930
With a noble heart and steadfast resolve—

62
00:05:56,930 --> 00:05:59,409
Marshal of the Dark Altar,
God of Wealth...

63
00:05:57,020 --> 00:05:59,740
♪ Smoke and breath, drawn in and out ♪

64
00:05:59,610 --> 00:06:02,000
The Fifth Batou has been taken
to the Fan family.

65
00:05:59,770 --> 00:06:02,740
♪ Yellow paper charms,
half mad, half divine ♪

66
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:03,930
Golden light appears immediately,

67
00:06:03,930 --> 00:06:06,080
♪ Heaven's Stems and Earthly Branches,
he waves them about ♪

68
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,120
protecting your true self.

69
00:06:06,730 --> 00:06:09,110
♪ Five Elements, Eight Trigrams,
all smoke and mirrors ♪

70
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,930
♪ The fortune-teller's tongue
is full of lies ♪

71
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:14,930
♪ Blows from the front,
arrows from behind, dark thoughts strike ♪

72
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,320
Sir,

73
00:06:15,170 --> 00:06:15,930
put the money

74
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,410
into the furnace.

75
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:18,930
Master,

76
00:06:19,850 --> 00:06:21,250
these are all banknotes.

77
00:06:21,380 --> 00:06:23,510
Won't they all burn up in that furnace?

78
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:26,590
This furnace holds heavenly fire.

79
00:06:26,900 --> 00:06:29,630
It can burn all things
and give birth to all things.

80
00:06:29,630 --> 00:06:31,170
Just put them in.

81
00:06:40,820 --> 00:06:42,550
Let's play the long game.

82
00:06:56,570 --> 00:06:58,220
[Reject]

83
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:12,880
Master,

84
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:14,710
why won't this lid close?

85
00:07:15,490 --> 00:07:16,200
Sir,

86
00:07:16,370 --> 00:07:18,580
I've already invited the God of Wealth.

87
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:20,680
You must be sincere.

88
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,730
Master,

89
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,050
I am sincere.

90
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,880
The sun and moon themselves
can bear witness to that.

91
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:25,530
Master,

92
00:07:26,170 --> 00:07:27,730
could it be that his ancestors

93
00:07:27,730 --> 00:07:29,260
don't recognize the money?

94
00:07:34,810 --> 00:07:35,900
His wish

95
00:07:36,050 --> 00:07:37,450
has reached the heavens.

96
00:07:37,530 --> 00:07:38,659
The God of Wealth has

97
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:41,050
personally opened
the Gate of Heaven for you.

98
00:07:41,050 --> 00:07:42,170
However...

99
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:44,000
your ancestors

100
00:07:44,170 --> 00:07:46,230
only recognize real gold and silver.

101
00:07:53,490 --> 00:07:54,320
To be honest,

102
00:07:55,450 --> 00:07:56,610
I'm not sure...

103
00:07:57,850 --> 00:07:59,440
whether my dad will give me any money.

104
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:00,770
Talk to your dad nicely.

105
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:03,360
Tell him you're borrowing the money,
not asking for it,

106
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:05,620
and that you'll pay him back
in a few days.

107
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:08,560
It's hard.

108
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,610
I've never heard of

109
00:08:09,610 --> 00:08:11,910
a father refusing to
lend money to his son.

110
00:08:11,910 --> 00:08:13,000
It's a long story.

111
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:15,730
Well...

112
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,050
your woman...

113
00:08:20,290 --> 00:08:21,520
Once I've saved up enough money,

114
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,760
I'll get you out of here.

115
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,170
Then we can be together.

116
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:26,520
The legitimate and concubine-born children
are not equal.

117
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:27,520
Not to mention,

118
00:08:28,050 --> 00:08:30,980
you don't even count
as my dad's concubine-born son.

119
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:32,330
Let's go.

120
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,170
Master.

121
00:08:58,170 --> 00:08:59,480
Don't keep calling me "Master."

122
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,650
Be good.

123
00:09:00,650 --> 00:09:02,480
I'll marry you then.

124
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,810
Master!

125
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,330
Who is it?

126
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:12,080
Dad,

127
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,010
it's me,

128
00:09:13,250 --> 00:09:13,840
Xinze.

129
00:09:14,890 --> 00:09:16,160
Goddamn it.

130
00:09:16,530 --> 00:09:17,770
That brat.

131
00:09:18,130 --> 00:09:19,590
Always getting in the way.

132
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,010
Dad.

133
00:09:22,680 --> 00:09:24,770
Why are you in such a panic?
Something happened at the teahouse?

134
00:09:24,770 --> 00:09:26,300
Sort of. Something came up.

135
00:09:26,530 --> 00:09:27,050
Dad,

136
00:09:27,930 --> 00:09:29,390
can you lend me some money?

137
00:09:29,530 --> 00:09:30,410
What for?

138
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:31,840
I'm just borrowing it.

139
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:32,440
Two days.

140
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:34,140
I'll pay you back in 2 days.

141
00:09:34,170 --> 00:09:35,320
What trouble have you gotten into?

142
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,450
I didn't get into any trouble.

143
00:09:36,450 --> 00:09:37,080
Don't worry, Dad.

144
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,290
I won't cause you any trouble.

145
00:09:38,290 --> 00:09:39,600
Just spit it out!

146
00:09:49,890 --> 00:09:50,950
What are you doing?

147
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:55,260
The God of Wealth is
waiting for me in heaven.

148
00:09:55,370 --> 00:09:55,870
Who?

149
00:09:55,890 --> 00:09:57,090
The God of Wealth!

150
00:09:59,410 --> 00:10:00,960
Dad, please help me.

151
00:10:01,290 --> 00:10:02,490
I am the God of Wealth!

152
00:10:02,570 --> 00:10:04,290
You look smart,

153
00:10:04,490 --> 00:10:06,350
but you keep doing stupid things!

154
00:10:07,770 --> 00:10:09,100
Get the hell out of here!

155
00:10:11,430 --> 00:10:12,200
Nuts!

156
00:10:17,410 --> 00:10:18,370
Fan Zhehan...

157
00:10:19,410 --> 00:10:21,270
didn't do anything to you, did he?

158
00:10:22,730 --> 00:10:24,130
He doesn't have the guts.

159
00:10:25,290 --> 00:10:26,680
You came all this way

160
00:10:27,650 --> 00:10:28,840
just to ask me this?

161
00:10:33,250 --> 00:10:34,200
It's obvious

162
00:10:34,410 --> 00:10:35,800
Mei Xuanzi is after you.

163
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,540
He's not easy to deal with.

164
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:39,580
Maybe I should just take you away.

165
00:10:39,770 --> 00:10:42,250
I finally managed to
stay at the Fan residence.

166
00:10:42,250 --> 00:10:43,560
How can I just leave?

167
00:10:44,170 --> 00:10:45,050
Besides,

168
00:10:45,410 --> 00:10:46,320
my staying here

169
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:49,260
can keep their attention on me

170
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,750
and...

171
00:10:51,590 --> 00:10:53,050
save you some trouble too.

172
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,780
Fan Xinze has already taken the bait.

173
00:10:59,050 --> 00:11:01,010
He's even calling me the God of Wealth.

174
00:11:01,010 --> 00:11:02,470
What trouble could I have?

175
00:11:03,010 --> 00:11:04,070
As for you, though,

176
00:11:04,890 --> 00:11:06,950
I'm afraid they'll be rough with you.

177
00:11:07,050 --> 00:11:09,650
I know a thing or two about fighting too.

178
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:13,040
I'm worried Fan Zhehan won't be able to
restrain himself.

179
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,080
If that were really the case,

180
00:11:17,790 --> 00:11:19,920
it might actually make things easier.

181
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:37,010
The rouge is mixed with poisonous powder.

182
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,530
Then do me a favor.

183
00:11:49,700 --> 00:11:50,370
How did it go?

184
00:11:50,370 --> 00:11:51,230
Did your dad...

185
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,380
give you the money?

186
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:54,200
No.

187
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,800
He gave me a beating instead.

188
00:11:58,480 --> 00:11:59,440
What should we do now?

189
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,840
He wouldn't give it to me.

190
00:12:03,410 --> 00:12:04,870
I'll just go get it myself.

191
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:24,560
Master,

192
00:13:25,410 --> 00:13:27,340
is there anything else I need to do?

193
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:28,550
You just need

194
00:13:28,750 --> 00:13:30,480
to kneel on the prayer cushion,

195
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:32,770
recite the scripture 49 times,

196
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,840
wait for the furnace to be opened

197
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,650
at three quarters past noon tomorrow,

198
00:13:36,650 --> 00:13:37,960
and take the gold.

199
00:13:38,420 --> 00:13:39,490
Remember—

200
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,320
sincerity is

201
00:13:41,770 --> 00:13:42,830
what makes it work.

202
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,730
With such a huge setup to break the curse,

203
00:14:31,730 --> 00:14:33,290
can it really wrap up
before my dad's back?

204
00:14:33,290 --> 00:14:34,250
How would I know?

205
00:14:34,370 --> 00:14:35,970
You'll have to ask our elder.

206
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:54,100
While cultivating alone
in Golden Flower Cave,

207
00:14:54,300 --> 00:14:57,220
I watched
the peach blossoms wither freely.

208
00:14:57,420 --> 00:15:00,350
Today I come here
to display my spiritual power;

209
00:15:00,750 --> 00:15:04,150
in years to come, my reputation
will spread across the world!

210
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:16,700
He's already gone.

211
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,620
You can stop chanting.

212
00:15:24,050 --> 00:15:24,930
I didn't expect

213
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:28,740
to come up against you,
Yuehaitang Branch's grandmaster, today.

214
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:30,930
Then why don't you

215
00:15:30,930 --> 00:15:32,560
show me some new tricks?

216
00:15:33,410 --> 00:15:35,410
All you've got
are these worn-out old tricks.

217
00:15:35,410 --> 00:15:36,560
Boring.

218
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,120
New tricks or old tricks—

219
00:15:38,250 --> 00:15:40,580
as long as they work, they're good tricks.

220
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,200
Master Mei,

221
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,800
you've treated me like this—

222
00:15:54,530 --> 00:15:56,260
do you think the Tianxiang Sect

223
00:15:56,690 --> 00:15:57,720
will let you off?

224
00:15:58,010 --> 00:15:59,440
In a few months,

225
00:16:00,290 --> 00:16:02,250
who knows if the Tianxiang Sect

226
00:16:02,250 --> 00:16:03,410
will still exist.

227
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:07,140
What are you trying to say?

228
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:09,800
The Tianxiang Sect isn't
as united as it looks.

229
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:11,740
Otherwise,

230
00:16:12,010 --> 00:16:13,200
how would I know

231
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,720
that you're going to
set up the Fan family?

232
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:19,600
That's hardly a secret anymore, is it?

233
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:22,600
Does your Sect Master know
his right-hand woman

234
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:24,630
is going to rebel?

235
00:16:30,530 --> 00:16:32,290
I don't understand
what you're talking about.

236
00:16:32,290 --> 00:16:33,290
Stop pretending.

237
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:35,960
Come to think of it,

238
00:16:36,780 --> 00:16:39,180
we're on the same side now.

239
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:49,050
Master Mei, looks like

240
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:51,130
you're a straightforward man.

241
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:53,050
In that case,

242
00:16:53,910 --> 00:16:55,640
let's be frank with each other.

243
00:16:58,250 --> 00:16:59,650
What exactly do you want?

244
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:03,040
Right now, the Fan family has asked me
to break your curse.

245
00:17:03,530 --> 00:17:04,720
Cooperate with me.

246
00:17:05,170 --> 00:17:07,000
Let's both give a little on this,

247
00:17:07,280 --> 00:17:09,170
and I'll make it worth your while.

248
00:17:13,930 --> 00:17:15,720
Your appetite

249
00:17:16,569 --> 00:17:17,970
shouldn't be this small.

250
00:17:17,970 --> 00:17:19,970
How you scheme reflects who you are.

251
00:17:20,890 --> 00:17:23,369
Trust builds slowly over time.

252
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:26,930
The Tianxiang Sect

253
00:17:27,369 --> 00:17:28,850
is on the eve of a storm.

254
00:17:29,410 --> 00:17:31,440
On the contrary, my Plum Blossom Sect

255
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,280
is peaceful and stable.

256
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,280
I admire you very much.

257
00:17:38,130 --> 00:17:38,930
In the future,

258
00:17:39,570 --> 00:17:41,930
you're very welcome to come visit my sect.

259
00:17:53,850 --> 00:17:55,680
Now it's three quarters past noon.

260
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:57,740
You can get the gold from the furnace.

261
00:18:14,370 --> 00:18:15,200
Remember—

262
00:18:15,650 --> 00:18:16,930
do not be greedy.

263
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:19,530
I'll heed your teachings.

264
00:18:25,890 --> 00:18:26,960
So I can take it now?

265
00:18:27,370 --> 00:18:27,970
Of course.

266
00:18:28,570 --> 00:18:29,370
Go take a look.

267
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:33,650
Be careful.

268
00:18:33,650 --> 00:18:34,850
See? I told you.

269
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,680
You can barely stand now.

270
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,090
-Be careful.
-I'm fine.

271
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:39,920
Let me see my money first.

272
00:18:57,900 --> 00:18:59,690
These gold bars are all real!

273
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:02,640
Your qi and blood
are both depleted right now.

274
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:03,840
Don't get too excited.

275
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:06,200
Go home and rest for a couple of days
before going out again.

276
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:07,370
This little bit of hardship is nothing.

277
00:19:07,370 --> 00:19:08,000
I'm fine.

278
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,480
You're fine now,

279
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:11,010
but it's going to get worse.

280
00:19:13,390 --> 00:19:14,520
How bad could it get?

281
00:19:14,930 --> 00:19:16,190
The first time I took my past-life wealth,

282
00:19:16,190 --> 00:19:17,430
I didn't take it seriously either.

283
00:19:17,430 --> 00:19:18,880
In less than 45 minutes,

284
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:20,680
I had blood in my urine and diarrhea.

285
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:22,810
I was bedridden for several days
before I recovered.

286
00:19:22,810 --> 00:19:23,680
That sounds...

287
00:19:24,650 --> 00:19:25,480
really awful.

288
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,330
Exactly.

289
00:19:28,760 --> 00:19:29,620
Mr. Shangguan.

290
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:34,280
Come with me...

291
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:36,720
to watch a good show.

292
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:39,040
Miss Wantang,

293
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:40,410
has

294
00:19:40,890 --> 00:19:42,150
the curse been lifted?

295
00:19:42,380 --> 00:19:43,510
I don't know either.

296
00:19:44,090 --> 00:19:45,930
Anyway, Master Mei said

297
00:19:46,190 --> 00:19:47,760
the curse has already been lifted.

298
00:19:47,760 --> 00:19:49,080
Guess I'm...

299
00:19:49,570 --> 00:19:50,720
undone as well.

300
00:19:52,570 --> 00:19:53,720
Young Master Fan,

301
00:19:54,130 --> 00:19:56,130
why are you always so impatient?

302
00:19:56,610 --> 00:19:57,760
Before,

303
00:19:58,280 --> 00:19:59,850
another master told me

304
00:20:00,620 --> 00:20:02,570
that even after my curse was removed,

305
00:20:02,570 --> 00:20:04,280
I still had to wait 3 days

306
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:06,720
before I could be intimate with someone.

307
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:08,890
Why do we still have to wait 3 days?

308
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:12,090
I'm just worried

309
00:20:12,330 --> 00:20:14,330
it might hurt your health.

310
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:15,610
Is that so?

311
00:20:17,040 --> 00:20:18,370
How bad could it be?

312
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:21,410
I don't know either.

313
00:20:22,330 --> 00:20:22,930
It's fine.

314
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:24,170
I'm hard to kill.

315
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:25,130
Let's do it.

316
00:20:27,890 --> 00:20:29,090
Naughty.

317
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:35,520
Wait.

318
00:20:36,330 --> 00:20:37,810
Hasn't the curse been lifted?

319
00:20:37,810 --> 00:20:39,870
Why are you still holding this thing?

320
00:20:41,850 --> 00:20:43,250
Master Mei's magic power

321
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:44,610
is definitely not enough.

322
00:20:44,610 --> 00:20:45,650
You may trust him,

323
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:47,220
but I certainly don't.

324
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:48,720
Young Master Fan, have you forgotten?

325
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:50,040
That day, the moment that Heavenly Dragon

326
00:20:50,040 --> 00:20:51,720
crawled onto me, it died.

327
00:20:52,130 --> 00:20:54,930
That just shows
how strong the poison in my body is.

328
00:20:55,370 --> 00:20:56,660
So, just to be safe,

329
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:58,760
we should stick with the old method.

330
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:00,200
Just bear with it

331
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:01,770
and wear this talisman.

332
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:02,890
After 3 days,

333
00:21:03,470 --> 00:21:04,890
you won't have
to put up with this anymore.

334
00:21:04,890 --> 00:21:05,570
Enough!

335
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:08,240
I've never had to
put up with this kind of crap...

336
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:09,330
I'm just doing this

337
00:21:09,330 --> 00:21:10,960
for your own good.

338
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,480
Then how about...

339
00:21:13,810 --> 00:21:15,090
you wait 3 more days?

340
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:23,720
Fine.

341
00:21:24,610 --> 00:21:26,410
I'll wait another 3 days.

342
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:29,330
Make sure you can handle it then.

343
00:21:31,210 --> 00:21:32,670
I'll be ready and waiting.

344
00:21:51,890 --> 00:21:53,410
Everyone here today

345
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:55,370
is my buddy who has stood by me

346
00:21:55,650 --> 00:21:57,410
through life and death.

347
00:21:57,760 --> 00:21:59,220
We've fought side by side!

348
00:21:59,330 --> 00:22:00,720
This is my only son.

349
00:22:01,130 --> 00:22:02,090
He's handsome, dignified—

350
00:22:02,090 --> 00:22:03,280
a fine young man.

351
00:22:03,650 --> 00:22:05,110
He takes after his mother.

352
00:22:07,040 --> 00:22:08,680
He certainly didn't get that from me.

353
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:10,000
Since he's my son,

354
00:22:10,410 --> 00:22:11,850
he's your son too!

355
00:22:12,090 --> 00:22:14,490
Now that he's wearing
this uniform as well,

356
00:22:15,130 --> 00:22:16,650
whatever you all need in the future,

357
00:22:16,650 --> 00:22:17,960
just give him orders.

358
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:19,720
He's just your...

359
00:22:20,130 --> 00:22:21,480
foot soldier!

360
00:22:28,890 --> 00:22:29,760
Uh...

361
00:22:32,360 --> 00:22:33,160
What's wrong?

362
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:34,280
Well,

363
00:22:34,570 --> 00:22:35,960
uncles and elders,

364
00:22:36,170 --> 00:22:38,930
from now on, I'm your foot soldier.

365
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:40,000
Foot soldier.

366
00:22:45,680 --> 00:22:46,810
Where are you going?

367
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:50,040
The people here today are very important.

368
00:22:50,040 --> 00:22:51,090
Don't embarrass me.

369
00:22:51,090 --> 00:22:53,760
Dad, I'll explain later.

370
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:00,280
Foot soldier?

371
00:23:01,170 --> 00:23:02,630
More like a deserter to me.

372
00:23:03,130 --> 00:23:04,330
With him like that...

373
00:23:04,930 --> 00:23:07,190
The Four Pillars of Destiny I gave you...

374
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:09,440
are his.

375
00:23:11,630 --> 00:23:13,080
That's a brilliant idea.

376
00:23:14,440 --> 00:23:15,900
Why didn't I think of that?

377
00:23:22,010 --> 00:23:24,410
Bring me
his Four Pillars of Destiny first.

378
00:23:26,490 --> 00:23:30,950
[Four Pillars of Destiny]

379
00:23:35,090 --> 00:23:36,240
Please take a look.

380
00:23:38,320 --> 00:23:39,670
Then do me a favor.

381
00:23:40,890 --> 00:23:41,960
I'm just doing this

382
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:43,650
for your own good.

383
00:23:58,440 --> 00:23:59,200
Turn around!

384
00:24:01,180 --> 00:24:02,330
You old geezer,

385
00:24:02,570 --> 00:24:05,440
didn't you say the curse
on that woman was lifted?

386
00:24:05,610 --> 00:24:08,470
You made me embarrass myself
at the birthday party.

387
00:24:11,610 --> 00:24:12,760
Slow down.

388
00:24:12,950 --> 00:24:14,080
What's going on?

389
00:24:14,280 --> 00:24:16,370
I did break Miss Jiang's curse.

390
00:24:16,650 --> 00:24:17,680
Break, my foot!

391
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:19,170
Can you even break curses?

392
00:24:19,330 --> 00:24:21,810
You're just a dirty, s-stinking fraud!

393
00:24:22,890 --> 00:24:24,750
Then you must've done something with her.

394
00:24:24,750 --> 00:24:26,670
I didn't do anything.

395
00:24:26,810 --> 00:24:28,860
She only touched me for a moment, and I...

396
00:24:28,860 --> 00:24:30,090
Young Master, please calm down.

397
00:24:30,090 --> 00:24:31,930
I'll go back
and prepare some medicine for you.

398
00:24:31,930 --> 00:24:32,760
There's still hope.

399
00:24:32,760 --> 00:24:34,280
Then hurry up and prepare it.

400
00:24:34,280 --> 00:24:35,170
If you can't cure me, I'll...

401
00:24:35,170 --> 00:24:37,900
I'll have my dad
raid your whole den of swindlers!

402
00:24:55,440 --> 00:24:56,830
You bitch,

403
00:24:56,850 --> 00:24:59,040
what did you drug Fan Zhehan with?

404
00:24:59,520 --> 00:25:00,920
If you want the antidote,

405
00:25:01,230 --> 00:25:02,150
talk nicely.

406
00:25:02,170 --> 00:25:04,170
You have no right to bargain with me.

407
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:05,720
I'll just kill you if I want to...

408
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:06,570
Fine.

409
00:25:07,090 --> 00:25:08,240
Then do it.

410
00:25:09,280 --> 00:25:10,240
Kill me,

411
00:25:10,760 --> 00:25:12,760
and your scheme will come to nothing.

412
00:25:12,760 --> 00:25:14,360
When that happens, we'll see

413
00:25:14,480 --> 00:25:16,890
if you can leave the Fan residence alive.

414
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:19,450
Trying to get yourself killed?

415
00:25:19,650 --> 00:25:21,220
Then I'll grant your wish!

416
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:22,130
Master Mei,

417
00:25:22,610 --> 00:25:24,480
you've been busy running around
this whole time

418
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:26,160
just for these few scraps of money.

419
00:25:26,160 --> 00:25:27,420
Is that enough for you?

420
00:25:27,960 --> 00:25:29,760
Enough for the people under you?

421
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:32,380
Since we agreed to work together,

422
00:25:32,610 --> 00:25:34,060
why do you always pull out a knife

423
00:25:34,060 --> 00:25:35,610
whenever something happens?

424
00:25:35,610 --> 00:25:37,610
You still want to work together?

425
00:25:38,810 --> 00:25:41,070
Didn't we agree you'd cooperate with me?

426
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:42,890
If the curse just lifted like that

427
00:25:42,890 --> 00:25:43,890
and he bedded me,

428
00:25:44,410 --> 00:25:45,810
what the hell do I get out of it?

429
00:25:45,810 --> 00:25:47,570
At best, it'd be just compensation
for all my hard work.

430
00:25:47,570 --> 00:25:50,370
Even so, you should've
given me a heads-up.

431
00:25:53,370 --> 00:25:55,230
You've been around the block too.

432
00:25:55,280 --> 00:25:56,740
We all just play it by ear.

433
00:25:56,930 --> 00:25:58,860
Nobody scripts it out beforehand.

434
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:00,850
I've drugged him with Toad Powder.

435
00:26:00,850 --> 00:26:02,050
Here's the antidote.

436
00:26:02,570 --> 00:26:03,240
Take it.

437
00:26:04,610 --> 00:26:06,940
You actually have something like this...

438
00:26:55,040 --> 00:26:56,600
Help!

439
00:26:57,200 --> 00:26:58,410
Help!

440
00:26:58,610 --> 00:26:59,890
He's dead!

441
00:27:00,610 --> 00:27:02,240
Help!

442
00:27:02,610 --> 00:27:05,330
He's dead! Help!

443
00:27:06,810 --> 00:27:07,810
What should I do?

444
00:27:09,150 --> 00:27:10,230
He's dead...

445
00:27:26,520 --> 00:27:27,520
Young Master Fan,

446
00:27:28,170 --> 00:27:30,130
this old geezer was a fraud.

447
00:27:32,040 --> 00:27:34,090
He couldn't break my curse at all.

448
00:27:35,440 --> 00:27:38,970
This old rogue got what he deserved
for taking advantage of you.

449
00:27:44,330 --> 00:27:45,330
Old fraud.

450
00:27:45,330 --> 00:27:46,460
You deserved to die.

451
00:27:46,930 --> 00:27:48,440
Hurry up.

452
00:27:48,520 --> 00:27:49,920
Take him out and bury him.

453
00:27:58,330 --> 00:27:59,410
Young Master Fan,

454
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:02,040
but what am I supposed to do?

455
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:04,130
If you don't mind,

456
00:28:05,130 --> 00:28:07,040
just keep me by your side,

457
00:28:07,440 --> 00:28:07,960
okay?

458
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:08,650
Miss, Miss,

459
00:28:08,760 --> 00:28:10,370
I'm too fragile to be tied

460
00:28:10,930 --> 00:28:12,330
to a fate like yours.

461
00:28:13,170 --> 00:28:15,100
You should go back to your brothel.

462
00:28:15,370 --> 00:28:17,830
You'll surely meet
the man destined for you.

463
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:22,890
Why is my life so miserable?

464
00:28:24,330 --> 00:28:27,200
I finally met someone destined for me,

465
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:29,370
yet I can't stay by his side for life.

466
00:28:29,370 --> 00:28:29,850
Alright.

467
00:28:29,850 --> 00:28:32,080
Don't cry.

468
00:28:34,890 --> 00:28:35,720
Next life.

469
00:28:36,680 --> 00:28:39,410
We'll meet again
in the next life, if fate allows.

470
00:28:41,650 --> 00:28:43,250
I'll see you in the next life.

471
00:28:44,760 --> 00:28:45,760
Young Master Fan.

472
00:28:46,570 --> 00:28:47,890
Young Master Fan!

473
00:28:56,460 --> 00:28:58,960
[Chunfeng House]

474
00:29:24,040 --> 00:29:24,890
What are these?

475
00:29:24,890 --> 00:29:26,290
Medicine for your wound.

476
00:29:27,650 --> 00:29:28,710
I don't need these.

477
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:32,770
Why did you kill Mei Xuanzi?

478
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:35,570
He knew my identity
within the Tianxiang Sect

479
00:29:35,570 --> 00:29:36,970
and tried to threaten me.

480
00:29:37,730 --> 00:29:40,460
A wound needs to be treated slowly
with medicine.

481
00:29:41,240 --> 00:29:42,440
I don't have the time.

482
00:29:42,570 --> 00:29:43,370
I'm used to it.

483
00:29:51,110 --> 00:29:52,970
You'll get an infection this way.

484
00:29:58,410 --> 00:29:59,070
Don't move.

485
00:30:12,200 --> 00:30:14,530
Did your Sect Master
order you to kill him?

486
00:30:15,440 --> 00:30:17,280
Sect Master said he'd committed
every vile deed imaginable

487
00:30:17,280 --> 00:30:18,410
and deserved to die.

488
00:30:19,850 --> 00:30:21,650
Is he really that kind-hearted?

489
00:30:37,890 --> 00:30:39,280
I can tell you the truth.

490
00:30:39,960 --> 00:30:41,220
But do you dare hear it?

491
00:30:49,410 --> 00:30:50,240
Of course.

492
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:02,610
Aren't you afraid I'll poison you?

493
00:31:23,780 --> 00:31:26,580
If I were afraid of death,
I'd go home and feed pigs.

494
00:31:44,520 --> 00:31:45,330
Young Master Fan!

495
00:31:45,330 --> 00:31:46,930
Slow down, Young Master Fan!

496
00:32:20,890 --> 00:32:22,280
Why did you buy this?

497
00:32:22,610 --> 00:32:24,130
It's way too expensive.

498
00:32:24,760 --> 00:32:26,330
Weren't you saving money

499
00:32:26,810 --> 00:32:28,370
to buy my freedom?

500
00:32:30,680 --> 00:32:32,480
I've j-just saved enough money.

501
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:34,200
Young Master Fan,

502
00:32:34,560 --> 00:32:36,760
you really are loyal and devoted.

503
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:40,570
It's a pity.

504
00:32:41,370 --> 00:32:42,900
It's a pity that Yinlian...

505
00:32:44,000 --> 00:32:45,730
didn't have such good fortune.

506
00:32:46,170 --> 00:32:47,170
How did she die?

507
00:32:51,330 --> 00:32:52,330
Yinlian, she...

508
00:32:52,850 --> 00:32:53,280
She...

509
00:32:55,000 --> 00:32:56,130
How did she die?

510
00:32:58,570 --> 00:33:01,100
She was carrying
your elder brother's child.

511
00:33:01,180 --> 00:33:02,640
Your brother sent someone

512
00:33:03,000 --> 00:33:05,190
to force a bowl of medicine
down her throat.

513
00:33:05,190 --> 00:33:07,050
Not only did she lose the child...

514
00:33:08,170 --> 00:33:09,960
but she also lost her own life.

515
00:33:18,280 --> 00:33:19,850
Yinlian

516
00:33:20,040 --> 00:33:21,990
clung to her last breath

517
00:33:23,280 --> 00:33:25,570
as she waited for you all night.

518
00:33:26,150 --> 00:33:27,910
Right before she died,

519
00:33:28,130 --> 00:33:30,650
she kept calling out your name,

520
00:33:31,490 --> 00:33:35,360
saying you'd take her away from here soon.

521
00:33:52,440 --> 00:33:53,200
Sit tight.

522
00:34:00,090 --> 00:34:02,320
[Yucheng Police]

523
00:34:00,130 --> 00:34:01,570
Fan, come out!

524
00:34:01,810 --> 00:34:02,810
Fan, get out here!

525
00:34:03,040 --> 00:34:03,960
Come out!

526
00:34:03,850 --> 00:34:04,950
[Corrupt Cop, Heaven Will Not Forgive!]
[Plum Blossom Sect's Hard-Earned Money, Gone to Waste!]

527
00:34:04,570 --> 00:34:06,810
Come out!

528
00:34:07,280 --> 00:34:08,600
Fan, you get out here!

529
00:34:08,929 --> 00:34:11,520
Didn't you tell me
the man had already been buried?

530
00:34:11,520 --> 00:34:12,320
He was buried.

531
00:34:12,330 --> 00:34:13,530
He really was buried.

532
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:15,000
Who would've thought

533
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:17,130
those bastards would dig him up again?

534
00:34:17,250 --> 00:34:19,250
You do nothing but cause me trouble.

535
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:21,179
Everyone, listen to me!

536
00:34:21,179 --> 00:34:22,100
Our Master Mei

537
00:34:22,120 --> 00:34:24,370
went into Director Fan's house
and never came back.

538
00:34:24,370 --> 00:34:25,889
Fan treats human life like dirt

539
00:34:25,889 --> 00:34:27,080
and destroys the body to cover it up!

540
00:34:27,080 --> 00:34:28,679
Our sect donated every penny

541
00:34:28,770 --> 00:34:30,600
we earned to your police station.

542
00:34:30,600 --> 00:34:31,330
And you?

543
00:34:31,440 --> 00:34:32,639
You take the money and do nothing.

544
00:34:32,639 --> 00:34:33,850
You use us up, then toss us aside!

545
00:34:33,850 --> 00:34:34,929
You climb the ladder, then kick it away.

546
00:34:34,929 --> 00:34:35,889
You cast us off
once we're no longer useful

547
00:34:35,889 --> 00:34:37,159
and bite the hand that feeds you!

548
00:34:37,159 --> 00:34:38,639
Fan, get out here!

549
00:34:38,690 --> 00:34:40,040
Give us an explanation!

550
00:34:40,770 --> 00:34:42,000
Fan, get out here!

551
00:34:42,440 --> 00:34:43,690
Fan, get out here!

552
00:34:50,330 --> 00:34:51,460
You say Director Fan

553
00:34:51,639 --> 00:34:53,000
killed the man.

554
00:34:53,690 --> 00:34:54,210
But

555
00:34:54,639 --> 00:34:55,810
we need evidence.

556
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:57,730
I'll investigate this thoroughly

557
00:34:57,730 --> 00:34:58,730
and give you an explanation.

558
00:34:58,730 --> 00:35:01,640
Director Wang, you're truly
a just and upright official!

559
00:35:01,640 --> 00:35:03,100
Thank you, Director Wang!

560
00:35:03,160 --> 00:35:04,620
Thank you, Director Wang.

561
00:35:12,370 --> 00:35:12,970
Take this.

562
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:16,440
You don't have to memorize all the idioms

563
00:35:16,440 --> 00:35:17,280
that gentleman just taught you.

564
00:35:17,280 --> 00:35:18,340
Just use one or two.

565
00:35:18,600 --> 00:35:19,640
Using more idioms

566
00:35:19,690 --> 00:35:21,690
makes me look cultured, doesn't it?

567
00:35:23,850 --> 00:35:25,080
Next time there's a good deal like this,

568
00:35:25,080 --> 00:35:26,040
remember to find me.

569
00:35:26,040 --> 00:35:27,770
I'll absolutely devote myself

570
00:35:27,890 --> 00:35:28,600
unto death!

571
00:35:29,250 --> 00:35:30,080
I'm off. I'm off,

572
00:35:30,080 --> 00:35:30,560
dude.

573
00:35:32,520 --> 00:35:35,050
Two idioms
and you think you're a scholar now?

574
00:35:37,250 --> 00:35:39,810
How did Master Mei die so tragically?

575
00:35:40,850 --> 00:35:41,980
It's so terrifying.

576
00:35:42,730 --> 00:35:44,160
I was just about to ask you that.

577
00:35:44,160 --> 00:35:44,760
Director,

578
00:35:44,850 --> 00:35:46,850
I saw everything
when they were causing a scene.

579
00:35:46,850 --> 00:35:48,380
That's baseless nonsense!

580
00:35:48,930 --> 00:35:50,810
Master Mei did indeed come to our house,

581
00:35:50,810 --> 00:35:51,930
but when he left,

582
00:35:52,410 --> 00:35:53,670
he was perfectly fine.

583
00:35:54,440 --> 00:35:55,840
Then I'll leave this case

584
00:35:56,080 --> 00:35:56,890
to you.

585
00:35:57,640 --> 00:35:59,370
You must get to the bottom of it,

586
00:36:00,120 --> 00:36:00,890
or

587
00:36:01,160 --> 00:36:02,770
we won't be able to answer for this.

588
00:36:02,770 --> 00:36:03,330
Yes, sir!

589
00:36:04,120 --> 00:36:05,890
I'll personally oversee the investigation.

590
00:36:05,890 --> 00:36:06,690
Don't worry.

591
00:36:07,600 --> 00:36:10,330
The Plum Blossom Sect
can't stir up much trouble.

592
00:36:16,890 --> 00:36:18,810
The man is already dead.

593
00:36:19,560 --> 00:36:21,960
Now his men keep insisting that they gave

594
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:23,690
all their money to us.

595
00:36:24,480 --> 00:36:25,370
Could they be

596
00:36:25,690 --> 00:36:27,810
talking about those 3 gold bars?

597
00:36:28,040 --> 00:36:29,930
The Plum Blossom Sect case is closed.

598
00:36:29,930 --> 00:36:32,680
These are
a token of their respect for you.

599
00:36:33,850 --> 00:36:34,600
Just these?

600
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:36,770
Their entire sect

601
00:36:37,080 --> 00:36:38,930
only made 3 gold bars?

602
00:36:39,330 --> 00:36:39,930
Oh, right.

603
00:36:40,510 --> 00:36:42,950
This must've been Mei Xuanzi's doing.

604
00:36:47,150 --> 00:36:50,350
Even so, we can't take the fall
for something we didn't do.

605
00:36:51,070 --> 00:36:52,130
Do you understand?

606
00:36:53,440 --> 00:36:54,700
Rest assured, Director.

607
00:36:54,700 --> 00:36:56,020
I'll definitely

608
00:36:56,700 --> 00:36:57,560
find the money.

609
00:37:23,200 --> 00:37:25,600
Master.

610
00:37:25,630 --> 00:37:27,400
Master.

611
00:37:28,290 --> 00:37:28,770
Master.

612
00:37:31,080 --> 00:37:31,480
Fan...

613
00:37:32,120 --> 00:37:33,000
Fan Xinze!

614
00:37:33,810 --> 00:37:35,610
Where is that bastard Fan Xinze?

615
00:37:35,690 --> 00:37:37,520
I want Fan Xinze!

616
00:37:37,930 --> 00:37:38,530
Director,

617
00:37:38,730 --> 00:37:40,730
the Young Master
went out early this morning.

618
00:37:40,730 --> 00:37:41,640
He was carrying

619
00:37:41,850 --> 00:37:43,510
an extremely heavy suitcase.

620
00:37:45,080 --> 00:37:45,730
Director!

621
00:37:47,410 --> 00:37:48,040
Master?

622
00:37:48,520 --> 00:37:49,250
Master...

623
00:37:51,340 --> 00:37:52,000
Someone, help!

624
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:53,060
Where is everyone?

625
00:37:56,690 --> 00:37:57,370
Mr. Fan,

626
00:37:57,860 --> 00:37:59,290
you need to think this through.

627
00:37:59,290 --> 00:38:00,880
If you put all this money into it,

628
00:38:00,880 --> 00:38:03,410
I'm afraid
your elder brother won't survive!

629
00:38:05,600 --> 00:38:07,160
A bastard like him...

630
00:38:08,620 --> 00:38:10,410
deserves to go to hell.

631
00:38:32,600 --> 00:38:33,600
I dug up

632
00:38:34,030 --> 00:38:35,280
that old man.

633
00:38:37,210 --> 00:38:38,010
I was only paid

634
00:38:38,770 --> 00:38:39,930
2 silver dollars.

635
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:46,260
Only 2 silver dollars?

636
00:38:51,180 --> 00:38:52,580
Who told you to dig him up?

637
00:38:52,930 --> 00:38:54,060
I don't know the man.

638
00:38:55,600 --> 00:38:57,000
Who told you to dig him up?

639
00:38:57,120 --> 00:38:58,440
I really don't know that man.

640
00:38:58,440 --> 00:39:00,370
Then you're the one who killed him.

641
00:39:00,580 --> 00:39:01,140
No, no!

642
00:39:01,160 --> 00:39:01,640
No, no!

643
00:39:01,640 --> 00:39:02,520
This has nothing to do with me!

644
00:39:02,520 --> 00:39:02,850
No,

645
00:39:02,880 --> 00:39:04,160
I really didn't kill him!

646
00:39:04,160 --> 00:39:04,690
Director!

647
00:39:04,690 --> 00:39:06,290
I'm begging you, Master!

648
00:39:06,330 --> 00:39:06,850
Really!

649
00:39:06,850 --> 00:39:08,440
Rough him up a little first.

650
00:39:09,640 --> 00:39:10,600
Stop!

651
00:39:10,600 --> 00:39:12,250
I'll talk! I'll talk!

652
00:39:12,330 --> 00:39:12,810
Tell me!

653
00:39:15,080 --> 00:39:17,210
It was the manager of this restaurant.

654
00:39:17,640 --> 00:39:19,000
I saw him take a rickshaw

655
00:39:19,560 --> 00:39:20,760
toward Yunhe Temple.

656
00:39:23,460 --> 00:39:25,060
Yunhe Temple?

657
00:39:45,770 --> 00:39:47,970
Why does the energy feel blocked today?

658
00:39:49,370 --> 00:39:50,000
Master,

659
00:39:50,480 --> 00:39:51,280
what's wrong?

660
00:39:54,160 --> 00:39:55,020
Mr. Shangguan,

661
00:39:55,160 --> 00:39:57,200
your Four Pillars of Destiny
clash with today's energies.

662
00:39:57,200 --> 00:39:58,360
If you stay here,

663
00:39:58,530 --> 00:40:00,340
it will affect the ritual.

664
00:40:01,250 --> 00:40:01,890
Well...

665
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:06,460
Then I'd better step away.

666
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:07,930
I'm just worried

667
00:40:08,040 --> 00:40:09,000
it'll seem disrespectful to you, Mr. Fan.

668
00:40:09,000 --> 00:40:09,600
It's fine.

669
00:40:09,960 --> 00:40:11,220
I can handle it myself.

670
00:40:11,330 --> 00:40:11,860
Alright.

671
00:40:12,250 --> 00:40:13,000
Then I'll...

672
00:40:13,520 --> 00:40:14,850
wait for your good news.

673
00:40:56,690 --> 00:40:57,850
Have you lost your mind?

674
00:40:57,850 --> 00:40:59,250
You've lost your mind, haven't you?

675
00:40:59,250 --> 00:41:00,330
You brat,

676
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:02,540
you actually dared to steal my money!

677
00:41:02,850 --> 00:41:03,730
I'm sorry.

678
00:41:03,730 --> 00:41:04,730
Where's my money?

679
00:41:04,810 --> 00:41:06,330
I told you, I'm borrowing it,

680
00:41:06,330 --> 00:41:07,250
but you wouldn't lend it to me.

681
00:41:07,250 --> 00:41:09,330
What father wouldn't lend his son money?

682
00:41:09,330 --> 00:41:10,160
I don't have a son like you.

683
00:41:10,160 --> 00:41:11,160
Where is my money?

684
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:12,720
Once this ritual is over,

685
00:41:12,720 --> 00:41:14,600
you can have as much lousy money
as you want.

686
00:41:14,600 --> 00:41:15,640
You idiot!

687
00:41:15,640 --> 00:41:17,080
Director Fan, please calm down.

688
00:41:17,080 --> 00:41:18,000
Your son

689
00:41:18,210 --> 00:41:19,370
means well.

690
00:41:19,640 --> 00:41:21,570
He's trying to make the money grow.

691
00:41:21,890 --> 00:41:24,120
The money is all in this furnace.

692
00:41:24,290 --> 00:41:26,520
The ritual will be over soon.

693
00:41:26,930 --> 00:41:28,100
Dad, trust me!

694
00:41:28,120 --> 00:41:28,770
Don't touch the furnace!

695
00:41:28,770 --> 00:41:30,290
If you touch it,
the ritual will be interrupted!

696
00:41:30,290 --> 00:41:31,520
Then we won't be able to
get the money back.

697
00:41:31,520 --> 00:41:32,730
It'll all be for nothing!

698
00:41:32,730 --> 00:41:34,330
If we leave it in the furnace,

699
00:41:34,770 --> 00:41:36,210
they'll take it away,

700
00:41:36,520 --> 00:41:38,050
and we'll never get it back.

701
00:41:38,120 --> 00:41:39,230
You fool!

702
00:41:39,250 --> 00:41:42,210
Why do you never trust me?

703
00:41:42,480 --> 00:41:44,810
I put 3 gold bars in with my own hands,

704
00:41:45,210 --> 00:41:47,540
and I took 6 gold bars out
with my own hands.

705
00:41:47,600 --> 00:41:49,600
This is the wealth from my past life!

706
00:41:50,520 --> 00:41:51,640
Past life, my foot!

707
00:41:51,730 --> 00:41:53,250
They've set a trap for you!

708
00:41:53,330 --> 00:41:55,080
They're just scamming you!

709
00:41:55,210 --> 00:41:56,810
Dad, trust me just this once.

710
00:41:57,120 --> 00:41:58,370
Once the ritual is over...

711
00:41:58,370 --> 00:41:59,440
Dad, don't touch it!

712
00:41:59,440 --> 00:41:59,840
Dad...

713
00:42:00,410 --> 00:42:02,340
Dad, trust me just this once, okay?

714
00:42:02,730 --> 00:42:03,520
Open the furnace.

715
00:42:03,520 --> 00:42:03,960
Dad.

716
00:42:04,250 --> 00:42:04,890
Dad, listen to me...

717
00:42:04,890 --> 00:42:05,560
Open it!

718
00:42:05,690 --> 00:42:06,150
Master.

719
00:42:06,530 --> 00:42:06,960
Master!

720
00:42:06,960 --> 00:42:07,640
Open it!

721
00:42:07,770 --> 00:42:08,690
Okay.

722
00:42:09,080 --> 00:42:10,730
Master... Master!

723
00:42:17,890 --> 00:42:18,850
What a pity.

724
00:42:19,040 --> 00:42:21,210
What a pity
your father interrupted the ritual.

725
00:42:21,210 --> 00:42:22,040
Mr. Fan,

726
00:42:22,330 --> 00:42:23,860
you're not fated to keep...

727
00:42:24,810 --> 00:42:26,140
your past-life wealth.

728
00:42:26,410 --> 00:42:27,740
It's all because of you.

729
00:42:28,370 --> 00:42:29,440
Everything I had going for me

730
00:42:29,440 --> 00:42:31,480
was ruined because of you.

731
00:42:31,850 --> 00:42:33,040
Past-life wealth?

732
00:42:38,000 --> 00:42:38,600
Come here.

733
00:42:38,800 --> 00:42:39,690
Director Fan, please calm down.

734
00:42:39,690 --> 00:42:41,020
Tell me right now—

735
00:42:41,040 --> 00:42:43,290
explain clearly what this "past-life wealth"
nonsense means,

736
00:42:43,290 --> 00:42:45,040
or I swear I'll shoot you dead!

737
00:42:45,370 --> 00:42:46,500
"Past-life wealth"

738
00:42:46,930 --> 00:42:49,080
means your son is trading his own life

739
00:42:49,250 --> 00:42:52,110
to reclaim your family's wealth
from the past life!

740
00:42:53,840 --> 00:42:56,000
[Four Pillars of Destiny]

741
00:42:55,240 --> 00:42:56,210
What a pity.

742
00:42:57,690 --> 00:43:00,040
What a pity that you're not fated

743
00:43:01,000 --> 00:43:02,660
to get your past-life wealth.

744
00:43:14,850 --> 00:43:16,110
Where did you get this?

745
00:43:16,690 --> 00:43:20,150
This is clearly your elder brother's
Four Pillars of Destiny.

746
00:43:20,290 --> 00:43:22,440
You used your elder brother's life

747
00:43:22,930 --> 00:43:24,460
to exchange for money here?

748
00:43:24,730 --> 00:43:26,530
Because ever since I was little,

749
00:43:27,640 --> 00:43:29,000
you always told me...

750
00:43:31,930 --> 00:43:33,930
my elder brother's life

751
00:43:34,890 --> 00:43:36,640
was worth more than mine!

752
00:43:37,040 --> 00:43:37,900
You're insane.

753
00:43:38,370 --> 00:43:40,430
I should've strangled you back then.

754
00:43:40,600 --> 00:43:41,890
I shouldn't have let you grow up.

755
00:43:41,890 --> 00:43:42,810
I should've strangled you

756
00:43:42,810 --> 00:43:45,600
along with that whore mother of yours!

757
00:43:45,910 --> 00:43:47,210
I'll take you down with me!

758
00:43:47,210 --> 00:43:48,270
I'll kill you!

759
00:43:48,290 --> 00:43:49,410
Kill, my foot!

760
00:43:58,640 --> 00:43:59,970
Are you trying to rebel?

761
00:44:00,050 --> 00:44:01,110
Take them all down!

762
00:44:04,930 --> 00:44:05,520
Fan.

763
00:44:06,000 --> 00:44:06,560
Fan!

764
00:44:07,730 --> 00:44:08,160
Director.

765
00:44:08,160 --> 00:44:09,360
What's going on here?

766
00:44:09,370 --> 00:44:09,970
Director.

767
00:44:11,040 --> 00:44:12,120
Why are you here?

768
00:44:13,410 --> 00:44:14,210
I...

769
00:44:14,210 --> 00:44:16,610
I... I'm dealing with some family matters.

770
00:44:16,810 --> 00:44:17,520
Kid,

771
00:44:18,080 --> 00:44:18,850
calm down.

772
00:44:19,640 --> 00:44:20,690
Put the gun down.

773
00:44:23,690 --> 00:44:24,480
Guo Qianli.

774
00:44:24,640 --> 00:44:25,170
Yes, sir.

775
00:44:26,960 --> 00:44:27,560
Director.

776
00:44:27,960 --> 00:44:29,020
Where is the stuff?

777
00:44:29,370 --> 00:44:30,160
-Director.
-Director,

778
00:44:30,160 --> 00:44:30,560
I...

779
00:44:33,520 --> 00:44:34,120
Director,

780
00:44:34,120 --> 00:44:34,520
I...

781
00:44:39,330 --> 00:44:40,370
So much money?

782
00:44:40,770 --> 00:44:41,560
Fan,

783
00:44:42,410 --> 00:44:44,670
even our two salaries combined wouldn't

784
00:44:44,810 --> 00:44:46,270
add up to this much, right?

785
00:44:47,500 --> 00:44:48,230
Director,

786
00:44:48,250 --> 00:44:50,410
I was just about to report to you.

787
00:44:50,640 --> 00:44:52,770
This is the unfilial son
my mistress bore me.

788
00:44:52,770 --> 00:44:55,480
He's been using my name
to extort money everywhere.

789
00:44:55,480 --> 00:44:56,640
I only just found out,

790
00:44:56,640 --> 00:44:57,890
and I'm dealing with it now.

791
00:44:57,890 --> 00:44:58,640
Kid,

792
00:44:59,190 --> 00:45:00,900
was this all your idea...

793
00:45:02,400 --> 00:45:04,310
or did someone put you up to this?

794
00:45:04,330 --> 00:45:06,410
My dad taught me all of this.

795
00:45:06,640 --> 00:45:08,920
He collected all this dirty money himself.

796
00:45:08,920 --> 00:45:10,320
I was just the errand boy.

797
00:45:10,480 --> 00:45:11,080
Director,

798
00:45:11,120 --> 00:45:13,190
don't listen to this bastard's nonsense!

799
00:45:13,190 --> 00:45:15,390
Fan Jialie of the Yucheng Police Bureau

800
00:45:15,690 --> 00:45:17,850
helped the Plum Blossom Sect
deal with the Tianxiang Sect,

801
00:45:17,850 --> 00:45:19,620
took 10 gold bars

802
00:45:19,650 --> 00:45:20,770
and several banknotes in bribes,

803
00:45:20,770 --> 00:45:23,080
and shielded his own son, Fan Zhehan,

804
00:45:23,080 --> 00:45:24,610
who murdered Miss Yinlian!

805
00:45:24,730 --> 00:45:27,160
If there is a single lie
in what I said today,

806
00:45:28,310 --> 00:45:31,440
I'll accept whatever punishment
you deem appropriate.

807
00:45:32,000 --> 00:45:32,730
Fan,

808
00:45:33,210 --> 00:45:34,940
you heard all that, didn't you?

809
00:45:38,730 --> 00:45:40,040
What are you doing?

810
00:45:44,850 --> 00:45:46,130
Fan,

811
00:45:47,000 --> 00:45:48,460
10 gold bars.

812
00:45:48,480 --> 00:45:50,120
You certainly have quite an appetite.

813
00:45:50,120 --> 00:45:50,960
Director,

814
00:45:51,160 --> 00:45:52,210
I've been framed!

815
00:45:52,290 --> 00:45:53,210
Fan Jialie,

816
00:45:53,910 --> 00:45:55,250
you have no regard for the law,

817
00:45:55,250 --> 00:45:56,600
taking bribes and perverting justice!

818
00:45:56,600 --> 00:45:59,000
You've disgraced the Party's trust in you.

819
00:45:59,080 --> 00:45:59,770
Director.

820
00:46:00,330 --> 00:46:02,210
Your son, Fan Zhehan,

821
00:46:02,330 --> 00:46:04,340
has already been
brought back to the bureau.

822
00:46:04,340 --> 00:46:07,180
You two will have plenty of time to talk.

823
00:46:07,810 --> 00:46:08,600
Take him back!

824
00:46:08,600 --> 00:46:09,210
Director!

825
00:46:09,390 --> 00:46:10,390
No, Director!

826
00:46:10,410 --> 00:46:11,560
It's a misunderstanding, Director!

827
00:46:11,560 --> 00:46:13,160
I'm begging you! I'm innocent!

828
00:46:13,160 --> 00:46:14,960
Director!

829
00:46:15,180 --> 00:46:15,640
Take them away!

830
00:46:15,640 --> 00:46:16,890
Director, I've been framed!

831
00:46:16,890 --> 00:46:17,730
Director!

832
00:46:18,040 --> 00:46:19,210
Take them!

833
00:46:33,770 --> 00:46:34,330
Move.

834
00:46:39,690 --> 00:46:40,520
Sect Master.

835
00:46:42,160 --> 00:46:43,840
I owe this all to you this time.

836
00:46:44,290 --> 00:46:47,370
I've finally rooted out the rotten apple
within the police force.

837
00:46:47,370 --> 00:46:49,160
Fortunately, you were still able to

838
00:46:49,160 --> 00:46:50,770
fix things afterward.

839
00:46:51,210 --> 00:46:53,810
If it hadn't been
for your timely information,

840
00:46:54,000 --> 00:46:55,250
we might not have

841
00:46:55,730 --> 00:46:57,850
recovered all the ill-gotten money.

842
00:46:58,040 --> 00:46:59,720
Do you remember what I told you?

843
00:46:59,720 --> 00:47:02,120
My staying here is better than leaving.

844
00:47:02,930 --> 00:47:04,410
Looks like your reputation
as the Iron Plate Fortune Teller

845
00:47:04,410 --> 00:47:05,810
is well deserved.

846
00:47:05,960 --> 00:47:07,690
As for the rest of your words,

847
00:47:07,690 --> 00:47:09,890
I can't quite figure them out.

848
00:47:10,040 --> 00:47:11,850
I'll be straight with you now.

849
00:47:12,410 --> 00:47:13,890
I'm afraid someone

850
00:47:14,480 --> 00:47:16,630
is trying to use you
to do their dirty work.

851
00:47:16,630 --> 00:47:17,240
Who?

852
00:47:17,270 --> 00:47:18,310
I don't dare say.

853
00:47:18,560 --> 00:47:19,770
But this person...

854
00:47:21,000 --> 00:47:22,160
is very close to you.

855
00:47:22,520 --> 00:47:23,890
I understand what you mean,

856
00:47:23,890 --> 00:47:24,740
Master.

857
00:47:24,860 --> 00:47:26,290
I have one more thing to ask.

858
00:47:26,290 --> 00:47:29,330
You want to know
whether I intend to stay or leave, right?

859
00:47:29,330 --> 00:47:30,160
By when do your superiors

860
00:47:30,160 --> 00:47:32,000
want your answer?

861
00:47:32,190 --> 00:47:33,190
Next month.

862
00:47:33,730 --> 00:47:35,790
Then, around this time next month...

863
00:47:36,640 --> 00:47:38,440
you'll understand everything.

864
00:47:39,370 --> 00:47:40,480
If I stay,

865
00:47:41,160 --> 00:47:42,960
you'll have good fortune.

866
00:47:44,410 --> 00:47:45,160
Sect Master,

867
00:47:45,410 --> 00:47:46,640
well said.

868
00:47:47,080 --> 00:47:48,250
I'll definitely think of you

869
00:47:48,250 --> 00:47:49,160
as a friend.

870
00:47:49,410 --> 00:47:50,040
Our paths

871
00:47:50,370 --> 00:47:52,000
will cross again.

872
00:47:52,160 --> 00:47:53,520
Our paths will cross again.

873
00:47:53,520 --> 00:47:54,850
I'll be taking my leave.

874
00:48:35,380 --> 00:48:37,560
[In the next episode]

875
00:48:37,690 --> 00:48:39,040
Let the two of them

876
00:48:40,160 --> 00:48:40,890
fight it out.

877
00:48:41,080 --> 00:48:42,010
What do you mean?

878
00:48:42,070 --> 00:48:44,360
If we're going to hunt, hunt a real tiger.

879
00:48:44,630 --> 00:48:46,580
Then who‘s the real tiger?

880
00:48:46,640 --> 00:48:48,240
Cao San of the Beggars' Sect.

881
00:48:48,480 --> 00:48:50,210
Greetings, Sect Leader!

882
00:48:50,410 --> 00:48:51,330
So,

883
00:48:52,170 --> 00:48:54,030
what are you planning to sell him?

884
00:48:54,960 --> 00:48:55,990
A beautiful dream.

885
00:48:55,990 --> 00:48:58,160
But you got your money by cheating people.

886
00:48:58,160 --> 00:48:59,000
It's dirty.

887
00:48:59,000 --> 00:49:00,730
Making money requires brains.

888
00:49:01,600 --> 00:49:02,330
Shopkeeper,

889
00:49:02,330 --> 00:49:04,260
congratulations on your opening!

890
00:49:04,330 --> 00:49:06,170
Are we really going up against Cao San?

891
00:49:06,170 --> 00:49:07,290
Let's make things

892
00:49:08,850 --> 00:49:09,850
even messier.
